      "content": "finding a different way to get it resolved? i've tried everything. lawyers, emails, showing up in person... it's like fighting a wall of fog. there is no \"other way.\" i just feel like the more i struggle, the more the world confirms that i'm just not supposed to be here. like the errors arent mistakes, they're just the world's way of saying i don't belong in it.",
